<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets China-related stocks warrant.</title>
<headline>SGA sets China-related stocks warrant.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV (SGA) said on Thursday it has issued 65 million American style call warrants on a basket of seven red-chips and locally-listed Chinese enterprises H-shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Anhui Expressway Co Ltd			 1.5 shares</p>
<p> Guangdong Kelon Electrical Holdings Co Ltd 1   share</p>
<p> Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd		   2   shares</p>
<p> Guangdong Investment Ltd			1   share</p>
<p> Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd			 1   share</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprise Ltd		0.4 shares</p>
<p> Ng Fung Hong Ltd				  1   share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$44.20	 PREMIUM	 17.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.7735	GEARING	 5.71x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  09.JAN.98	EXER LOT	50,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG     PAYMENT DATE  30.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>DISCRETION OF ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
